---
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="description" content="ClipClop 隐私说明：了解剪贴内容的本地保存、网络访问与系统权限。">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"><title>隐私说明 — ClipClop</title><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <script is:inline>try{const theme=localStorage.getItem("clipclop-theme");if(theme==="light"||theme==="dark")document.documentElement.dataset.theme=theme}catch{}</script>
  <style is:global>
    :root{color-scheme:light dark;--site-max-width:1440px;--site-gutter:clamp(20px,4vw,64px);--bg-shell:#17181a;--bg-raised:#1e2022;--bg-hover:#242628;--bg-selected:#2a2d30;--hairline:#2c2f32;--text-1:#ecedee;--text-2:#aeb3b7;--text-3:#8a9095;--action:#eceef0;--action-on:#17181a;--mono:ui-monospace,"SF Mono","Cascadia Code",Consolas,monospace;--sans:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI Variable","Segoe UI",system-ui,sans-serif;--panel-shadow:0 2px 5px rgb(0 0 0/.18),0 12px 24px rgb(0 0 0/.3);--dur-fast:140ms;--ease-out:cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}
    @media(prefers-color-scheme:light){:root{--bg-shell:#f2f3f4;--bg-raised:#fafbfb;--bg-hover:#eceeef;--bg-selected:#e2e5e8;--hairline:#d9dde0;--text-1:#1c1e20;--text-2:#5d6367;--text-3:#687076;--action:#1c1e20;--action-on:#fff;--panel-shadow:0 2px 5px rgb(24 28 32/.1),0 12px 24px rgb(24 28 32/.2)}}
    :root[data-theme=dark]{--bg-shell:#17181a;--bg-raised:#1e2022;--bg-hover:#242628;--bg-selected:#2a2d30;--hairline:#2c2f32;--text-1:#ecedee;--text-2:#aeb3b7;--text-3:#8a9095;--action:#eceef0;--action-on:#17181a;--panel-shadow:0 2px 5px rgb(0 0 0/.18),0 12px 24px rgb(0 0 0/.3)}:root[data-theme=light]{--bg-shell:#f2f3f4;--bg-raised:#fafbfb;--bg-hover:#eceeef;--bg-selected:#e2e5e8;--hairline:#d9dde0;--text-1:#1c1e20;--text-2:#5d6367;--text-3:#687076;--action:#1c1e20;--action-on:#fff;--panel-shadow:0 2px 5px rgb(24 28 32/.1),0 12px 24px rgb(24 28 32/.2)}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;color:var(--text-1);background:var(--bg-shell);font-family:var(--sans);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--text-1);outline-offset:3px}.privacy{width:min(1000px,calc(100vw - 2 * var(--site-gutter)));min-height:calc(100svh - 100px);margin:0 auto;padding:148px 0 100px}.privacy article{max-width:760px}.privacy h1{margin:0 0 18px;font-size:clamp(3.5rem,9vw,7rem);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.05em}.privacy h2{margin:48px 0 14px;padding-top:28px;border-top:1px solid var(--hairline);font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.01em}.privacy p{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--text-2);font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-wrap:pretty}.privacy .intro{max-width:680px;margin-bottom:54px;color:var(--text-2);font-size:17px;line-height:1.65}.privacy .intro+h2{margin-top:0}.privacy [hidden]{display:none}@media(max-width:650px){.privacy{padding-top:112px}.privacy p{font-size:15px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation-duration:.01ms!important;transition-duration:.01ms!important}}
    .privacy a{color:var(--text-1);text-underline-offset:4px}.privacy code{padding:2px 5px;border-radius:4px;color:var(--text-1);background:var(--bg-selected);font:13px var(--mono)}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <SiteHeader current="privacy" />
  <main class="privacy">
    <article data-privacy="zh">
      <h1>隐私说明</h1><p class="intro">ClipClop 将剪贴历史保存在你的设备上。核心的捕获、保存、搜索、预览与粘贴无需云端处理；应用没有账号、云同步、遥测、广告或内容分析服务，也不会在后台打开你复制的网址。</p>
      <h2>本地保存的数据</h2><p>ClipClop 会在本地保存受支持的剪贴板内容，以及相关的来源应用信息、文件路径引用和设置。应用不会检查内容并判断它是否敏感，因此请不要把剪贴历史视为密码保险库。</p><p>文件记录引用原文件的路径，不会复制或移动原文件。文件预览默认关闭；关闭时只显示已保存的名称、路径和来源信息。开启后，只有在你明确预览某个文件时，ClipClop 才可能读取该文件以取得大小、生成缩略图或调用系统预览。原文件不会上传。</p><p>本地数据库由当前系统账户以及 FileVault、BitLocker 等磁盘加密机制保护。ClipClop 目前不额外加密应用数据库。</p>
      <h2>网络访问</h2><p>启用自动检查更新后，ClipClop 最多每 24 小时访问一次由 Cloudflare 提供的 <code>clipclop.io</code>，用于比较版本和取得更新信息；只有在你选择更新时才会下载安装文件。</p><p>本网站的更新日志和 GitHub Star 数量来自 GitHub 的公开接口。上述请求都不包含剪贴板内容、历史记录、文件路径或来源应用信息。你可以在应用设置中关闭自动更新检查。</p>
      <h2>你的控制方式</h2><p>你可以删除单条记录、清空全部历史，并分别设置历史的保留时间和条目数量上限；达到任一上限后，ClipClop 会自动清理记录。启用“最近使用移到顶部”后，清理时间按条目的最后使用时间计算。退出 ClipClop 会停止新的剪贴板捕获。</p><p>卸载是否同时移除数据取决于操作系统和安装方式。如需删除全部本地数据，请先退出 ClipClop，再删除 <code>com.clipclop.desktop</code> 对应的应用数据目录。</p>
      <h2>开源与审查</h2><p>ClipClop 的代码和仓库完全公开。你可以在 <a href="https://github.com/hiQianFan/ClipClop" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a> 查看实现，独立核对应用保存了什么、何时读取文件以及何时访问网络。</p>
      <h2>系统权限</h2><p>在 macOS 上，可选的自动粘贴仅使用辅助功能权限，在你选择条目后发送粘贴快捷键。拒绝授权不会影响复制：ClipClop 仍会把所选内容放入系统剪贴板，你可以手动粘贴。</p><p>文件预览使用单独的完全磁盘访问权限。macOS 要求你手动授权并返回 ClipClop 确认后，应用才会读取原文件。你可以跳过、关闭或随时撤销这项权限；文件历史仍会显示已保存的基本信息。首次启动的快速入门只使用内置示例，不会展示你的剪贴历史。</p><p>如果未来加入遥测、云同步，或其他会处理剪贴板数据的联网功能，本说明将在相关版本发布前更新。</p>
    </article>
    <article data-privacy="en" hidden>
      <h1>Privacy</h1><p class="intro">ClipClop keeps clipboard history on your device. Core capture, storage, search, preview, and paste operations need no cloud processing. The app has no account, cloud sync, telemetry, advertising, or content-analysis service, and it never opens copied URLs in the background.</p>
      <h2>Data stored locally</h2><p>ClipClop stores supported clipboard content locally, together with related source-application metadata, file-path references, and settings. It does not inspect content to decide whether it is sensitive, so clipboard history should not be treated as a password vault.</p><p>File entries reference the original file path; ClipClop does not copy or move the original file. File preview is off by default and, while off, shows only stored names, paths, and source information. When enabled, ClipClop may read a file only after you explicitly preview it, to obtain its size, create a thumbnail, or invoke the system preview. The original file is never uploaded.</p><p>The local database relies on the current operating-system account and disk encryption such as FileVault or BitLocker. ClipClop does not currently add separate application-level database encryption.</p>
      <h2>Network access</h2><p>When automatic update checks are enabled, ClipClop contacts <code>clipclop.io</code>, served through Cloudflare, at most once every 24 hours to compare versions and retrieve update information. It downloads an installer only after you choose to update.</p><p>This website retrieves release history and the public GitHub star count from GitHub's public API. None of these requests includes clipboard content, history, file paths, or source-application metadata. Automatic update checks can be disabled in the app's Settings.</p>
      <h2>Your controls</h2><p>You can delete individual entries, clear all history, and set separate age and item-count limits. ClipClop removes records when either limit is reached. If “move recently used items to the top” is enabled, cleanup uses each item's last-used time. Quitting ClipClop stops new clipboard capture.</p><p>Whether uninstalling also removes data depends on the operating system and installation method. To remove all local data, quit ClipClop and delete the application data directory for <code>com.clipclop.desktop</code>.</p>
      <h2>Open source and auditability</h2><p>ClipClop's code and repository are public. You can inspect the implementation on <a href="https://github.com/hiQianFan/ClipClop" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a> to independently verify what the app stores, when it reads files, and when it accesses the network.</p>
      <h2>System permissions</h2><p>On macOS, optional automatic paste uses Accessibility permission only to send the paste shortcut after you choose an item. Denying permission does not prevent copying: ClipClop still places the selected content on the system clipboard so you can paste it manually.</p><p>File preview uses separate Full Disk Access permission. macOS requires you to grant it manually and return to ClipClop to confirm before the app reads original files. You can skip, disable, or revoke this permission at any time; file history will continue to show stored basic information. First-run Quick Start uses built-in examples and does not display your clipboard history.</p><p>This notice will be updated before any release that adds telemetry, cloud sync, or another network feature that processes clipboard data.</p>
    </article>
  </main><SiteFooter />
  <script>function showPrivacy(locale){document.documentElement.lang=locale==="zh"?"zh-CN":"en";document.title=locale==="zh"?"隐私说明 — ClipClop":"Privacy — ClipClop";document.querySelector('meta[name="description"]').content=locale==="zh"?"了解 ClipClop 如何在本地保存剪贴历史、何时访问网络，以及你可以使用的删除和权限控制。":"Learn how ClipClop stores clipboard history locally, when it accesses the network, and which deletion and permission controls are available.";document.querySelectorAll("[data-privacy]").forEach(section=>section.hidden=section.dataset.privacy!==locale)}let saved;try{saved=localStorage.getItem("clipclop-locale")}catch{}showPrivacy(saved==="zh"||saved==="en"?saved:navigator.language.toLowerCase().startsWith("zh")?"zh":"en");window.addEventListener("clipclop:locale",event=>showPrivacy(event.detail));</script>
</body>
</html>
